    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/6ec9c346aa594e737d8d32f152eae2b6.avif?t=1629245238\" /></div><br><br>Inspired by Voxel and FPS games, Dark Forest is a fast-paced shooter that places you in a forest arena to survive endless waves of monsters. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/01d45c28902f22b8d4580ea16220dec9.poster.avif?t=1629245238\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/01d45c28902f22b8d4580ea16220dec9.webm?t=1629245238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/01d45c28902f22b8d4580ea16220dec9.mp4?t=1629245238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Presuming that you liked our game and contemplating of buying Dark Forest please keep in mind that we are a very passionate but small team of three. This is not a big company experience with hours and hours of content. What we\u2019d like to offer you is a simple game that challenges you to survive and compete with people all around the world for the highest score or merely to unwind and unstress killing monsters using magic.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/c80e379eb385ff09822385a40db8c330.poster.avif?t=1629245238\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/c80e379eb385ff09822385a40db8c330.webm?t=1629245238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/c80e379eb385ff09822385a40db8c330.mp4?t=1629245238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/e1c753c231f61ba0b551982f70f99bde.avif?t=1629245238\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features: </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Face 12 Different Monsters.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3 different skills to use as you wish.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect mana to allow you to use the skills.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sprint bar that allows you to run faster.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Submit score to compete on global leaderboard.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>View the score of your friends and other people on leaderboard menu.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Recent Updates: </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Added a new monster: Watcher of the Abyss.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Added a texture of grass to the ground.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>FPS optimization and performance.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Changed mechanics in the use of skills.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/d3ce0098306e06bf3f1f07cb4d38cb44.poster.avif?t=1629245238\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/d3ce0098306e06bf3f1f07cb4d38cb44.webm?t=1629245238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/d3ce0098306e06bf3f1f07cb4d38cb44.mp4?t=1629245238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/6ec9c346aa594e737d8d32f152eae2b6.avif?t=1629245238\" /></div><br><br>Inspired by Voxel and FPS games, Dark Forest is a fast-paced shooter that places you in a forest arena to survive endless waves of monsters. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/01d45c28902f22b8d4580ea16220dec9.poster.avif?t=1629245238\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/01d45c28902f22b8d4580ea16220dec9.webm?t=1629245238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/01d45c28902f22b8d4580ea16220dec9.mp4?t=1629245238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Presuming that you liked our game and contemplating of buying Dark Forest please keep in mind that we are a very passionate but small team of three. This is not a big company experience with hours and hours of content. What we\u2019d like to offer you is a simple game that challenges you to survive and compete with people all around the world for the highest score or merely to unwind and unstress killing monsters using magic.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/c80e379eb385ff09822385a40db8c330.poster.avif?t=1629245238\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/c80e379eb385ff09822385a40db8c330.webm?t=1629245238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/c80e379eb385ff09822385a40db8c330.mp4?t=1629245238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/e1c753c231f61ba0b551982f70f99bde.avif?t=1629245238\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features: </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Face 12 Different Monsters.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3 different skills to use as you wish.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect mana to allow you to use the skills.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sprint bar that allows you to run faster.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Submit score to compete on global leaderboard.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>View the score of your friends and other people on leaderboard menu.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Recent Updates: </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Added a new monster: Watcher of the Abyss.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Added a texture of grass to the ground.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>FPS optimization and performance.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Changed mechanics in the use of skills.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/d3ce0098306e06bf3f1f07cb4d38cb44.poster.avif?t=1629245238\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/d3ce0098306e06bf3f1f07cb4d38cb44.webm?t=1629245238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043870/extras/d3ce0098306e06bf3f1f07cb4d38cb44.mp4?t=1629245238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
